  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production FAQs\n\n### How to submit a Dormant set of accounts to Companies House\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 25 Feb, 2022 at  4:01 PM\n\nTo submit your dormant accounts you can click on this link. Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below. \n\nNavigation: Accounts Production >> Choose the client >> Settings >> Report Settings >> Company Info >> Edit\n\nOnce you navigate to the page change the trading status as Dormant and then you may proceed further to prepare the Accounts Report.\n\nOnce the Accounts report is created, you can follow the next step to submit your accounts. This can be done by following the below navigation. \n\nNavigation: Tasks >> Submit >> Click on + Submit Accounts >> Choose the Accounts Report and then click on Submit to Companies House from the Accounts Production Module.\n\nPlease refer below screenshot for more help.\n\nClick here to watch how to prepare dormant accounts\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188543\">Accounts Production FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to submit a Dormant set of accounts to Companies House\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 25 Feb, 2022 at  4:01 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"></span></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 62.5%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/31b29b9489ec49058c8e3875b2be0621\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">To submit your dormant accounts you can <a href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/settings/report/company.aspx\"><strong>click on this link</strong></a>. <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Alternatively you can also follow the navigation as shown below.</span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: Accounts Production &gt;&gt; Choose the client &gt;&gt; Settings &gt;&gt; Report Settings &gt;&gt; Company Info &gt;&gt; Edit</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9148607118/original/kLXdZXWOy2MWsUbKxKtgiUZZb7UFCS8USw.gif?1641473678\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9148607118\"></span><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Once you navigate to the page change the trading status as Dormant and then you may proceed further to prepare the Accounts Report.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074125404/original/Zn3R3UbIRPgSD9AGx8L0jFN4de5jg1xw3Q.png?1553518001\" width=\"624\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074125404/original/Zn3R3UbIRPgSD9AGx8L0jFN4de5jg1xw3Q.png?1553518001\" data-fileid=\"9074125404\" data-uniquekey=\"1553517987822\" style=\"width: 996px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once the Accounts report is created, you can follow the next step to submit your accounts. This can be done by following the below navigation.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: Tasks &gt;&gt; Submit &gt;&gt; Click on + Submit Accounts &gt;&gt; Choose the Accounts Report and then click on Submit to Companies House from the Accounts Production Module.<br><br></span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please refer below screenshot for more help.</span></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074125403/original/Lrl5JGKwaq3TcWHaHwUirDTBcbKDRxx9gA.png?1553518001\" width=\"624\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9074125403/original/Lrl5JGKwaq3TcWHaHwUirDTBcbKDRxx9gA.png?1553518001\" data-fileid=\"9074125403\" data-uniquekey=\"1553517987822\" style=\"width: 1006px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/31b29b9489ec49058c8e3875b2be0621\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click here to watch how to prepare dormant accounts</span></strong></a></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165537\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165537/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165537\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"